4
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:11,041
Sandero.

5
00:00:13,208 --> 00:00:15,416
You can doubt
it all you want.

6
00:00:15,416 --> 00:00:16,708
When Steward Jeyn arrives, 

7
00:00:16,708 --> 00:00:18,250
you’ll
find out exactly.

8
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:19,208
ow you the hell is that?

9
00:00:19,208 --> 00:00:21,500
Steward Jeyn is the
Sovereign Sanctum’s representative

10
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,250
