never heard of him.

13
00:00:30,958 --> 00:00:32,125
What?

14
00:00:32,125 --> 00:00:34,458
Are you saying Steward Jeyn isn’t
important 

15
00:00:34,458 --> 00:00:35,541
enough for you to know?

16
00:00:36,125 --> 00:00:37,291
Exactly.

17
00:00:37,291 --> 00:00:39,250
He clearly never received my orders 

18
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:40,291
to the higher stewards:

19
00:00:40,291 --> 00:00:42,875
do not abuse power,
do not bully the weak.

20
00:00:42,875 --> 00:00:45,416
This Jeyn has
obviously ignored my rules.

21
00:00:47,208 --> 00:00:48,666
Enough, Severin.

22
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Drop the pathetic act.

23
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,125
I don’t care how you
leeched onto the Morellan family,

24
00:00:54,125 --> 00:00:56,125
