25
00:00:57,041 --> 00:01:00,291
Don’t blame me when
I make you regret it.

26
00:01:00,291 --> 00:01:02,458
You’ll make me regret it?

27
00:01:02,458 --> 00:01:04,833
What gives you the right?

28
00:01:04,833 --> 00:01:06,791
Do you truly
not understand who gave

29
00:01:06,791 --> 00:01:09,583
