37
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,583
Marrying Lord Severin is
an honor for me.

38
00:01:22,583 --> 00:01:25,416
I am the one who
is reaching above my station.

39
00:01:25,416 --> 00:01:28,291
Insult him again and
I will have you killed.

40
00:01:28,291 --> 00:01:31,166
I can’t stand
listening to him claim

41
00:01:31,166 --> 00:01:33,875
he’s responsible for
the Scott family’s success.

42
00:01:33,875 --> 00:01:35,458
If you don’t believe me,

43
00:01:35,458 --> 00:01:39,416
use your communication stone right now
and ask Lord Campbell of the

44
00:01:39,416 --> 00:01:43,208
Wastelands why he helped the
dying Scott family three years ago.

45
00:01:44,791 --> 00:01:47,791
I can't stand listening to him claim he's

46
00:01:47,791 --> 00:01:49,750
responsible for the Scott family's success.

47
00:01:50,958 --> 00:01:53,375
If you don't believe me use your communication stone

48
00:01:53,375 --> 00:01:55,708
right now and ask Lord Campbell of the wasteland why he

49
00:01:55,708 --> 00:01:57,875
helped the dying Scott family three years ago.

50
00:02:00,791 --> 00:02:03,083
How do you know about that?

51
00:02:05,166 --> 00:02:07,583
Because I told him to.

52
00:02:07,583 --> 00:02:09,791
Fine, I’ll call him.

53
00:02:10,125 --> 00:02:11,958
Today I'm exposing your

54
00:02:11,958 --> 00:02:13,583
lies in front of everyone!

55
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:18,500
Turn the volume up to maximum.

56
00:02:19,250 --> 00:02:20,875
