57
00:02:20,875 --> 00:02:23,333
Lady Livia, what can
I do for you?

58
00:02:23,333 --> 00:02:25,791
Lord Campbell, sorry to bother you.

59
00:02:25,791 --> 00:02:27,083
Just speak.

60
00:02:27,083 --> 00:02:28,125
I wanted to ask 

61
00:02:28,125 --> 00:02:31,291
three years 
ago, when you helped 
my family,

62
00:02:31,291 --> 00:02:32,791
