you to help us.

66
00:02:39,625 --> 00:02:42,125
I want to expose his
lie in front of everyone.

67
00:02:42,125 --> 00:02:43,875
Who is this person?

68
00:02:43,875 --> 00:02:45,333
It's my former fiancé,

69
00:02:45,333 --> 00:02:49,291
